After that time, we do not refund a period you have already paid for, unless one of these is true:

- the law gives you a right to a refund (see section 5);
- the Service did not work as we described, and we could not fix it within a reasonable time;
- we charged you by mistake, or charged a price you did not agree to.

If you cancel, you keep the plan until the end of the period you paid for and you are not charged again. If you choose to end the plan right now, we refund the unused part of the period only if one of the reasons above applies.
